title: "GSbench: Benchmarking Genomic Selection and Machine-Learning Prediction Models"
abstract: >-
  A unified interface to fit, cross-validate and benchmark genomic prediction models from SNP marker data, covering GBLUP, ridge-regression BLUP, machine-learning predictors and a stacked ensemble.
